My valk, who lost the only non-bag-of-tricks she'd found to a
gelatinous cube on Medusa's island (oops), was industriously
remodelling--er, "exploring"--Gehennom from the bottom up (gotta love
#invoking the Orb with a ring of teleport control!), when, much to her
surprise, she killed a giant spider and found it had been lugging
around another sack.  Sure, it's no BoH, but it'll keep scrolls and
potions from burning (and weight hasn't really been an issue so far).
And then, on the far side of the same level, she found a magic lamp
laying on the ground; when she 'ported back up to the Valley and
dropped it on the altar, it turned out to be blessed!

Woohoo!

